{"id":"331da47e9bdb","html":"<div><div><p>You are here: <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Blog</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/category/miscellany/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Miscellany</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> Typewriter interviews with Roz Chast and Paul Noth</p>\n<p><time datetime=\"2026-10-13T15:14:03-04:00\">Tuesday, October 13, 2026</time>  </p><div><p><a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/typewriter-interview-with-roz-chast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/c565d482-1007-4eaa-a904-078dd4087402_1024x1306-600x765.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"765\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p>This was not entirely pre-planned, but: it turns out I’m publishing a <a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/t/typewriter-interviews?sort=top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">typewriter interview</a> with a cartoonist every week of October, and I <em>just now</em> realized they’re all contributors to <em>The</em> <em>New Yorker. </em>The first two are&nbsp;<a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/typewriter-interview-with-roz-chast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Roz Chast</a> and <a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/typewriter-interview-with-paul-noth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Paul Noth</a>! (Can you guess the other two?)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/typewriter-interview-with-paul-noth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7d86b3a4-ab6b-4147-94f2-80e5644126a7_1024x1306-600x765.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"765\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n</div></div></div>"}